pcl:Lineage02 backlog:archivalTrigger "Found achieved and un-archived by backlog_lineage_archive_v2_1_0: mission Out_Achieved, closure report present, every item Done or Cancelled, not frozen. Owner's rule 2026-09-09: an achieved lineage found triggers the archival activity." ;
